@startuml post-manager-admin-account
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/manager/v1/admin-account
caption CRB-35 · 어드민 계정 등록 (superadmin 전용)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard\n+ SuperAdminGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminAccountController" as Controller
participant "AdminAccountService" as Service
participant "AdminAccountRepository" as AdminAccountRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: POST /api/manager/v1/admin-account\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>\n{ email, role? }
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard + SuperAdminGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found\n403 Superadmin privilege is required.
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt body 검증 실패 (email 형식 · 64자 초과, role이 admin · superadmin이 아님)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: create(req)
Controller -> Service: create(req)
Service -> Service: email trim + 소문자 변환
alt @gm.gist.ac.kr이 아님
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 Only gm.gist.ac.kr emails can be registered.
end
Service -> AdminAccountRepository: insertIfAbsent({ email, role ?? admin })
AdminAccountRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT admin_account\nON CONFLICT (email) DO NOTHING RETURNING
note right: 먼저 조회하지 않아 동시 요청이어도 500이 아니라 409
PostgreSQL --> AdminAccountRepository: row | 0행
alt 0행 (이미 등록된 이메일)
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 409 This admin email is already registered.
end
Service --> Controller: AdminAccountDto
Controller --> Client: 201 { pk, email, role, created_at, updated_at }

@enduml
